|                   | To support departments |                         |
|                   | in providing an        |                         |
|                   | accessible curriculum  |                         |
|                   | for all, we have       |                         |
|                   | several PLS            |                         |
|                   | departments that       |                         |
|                   | provide advice,        |                         |
|                   | guidance and training. |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | The Learning Support   |                         |
|                   | Team provide support   |                         |
|                   | throughout the learner |                         |
|                   | journey. This can      |                         |
|                   | start before they      |                         |
|                   | arrive in September,   |                         |
|                   | meeting with learners, |                         |
|                   | familiarising them     |                         |
|                   | with the environment,  |                         |
|                   | providing pen profiles |                         |
|                   | in advance of the      |                         |
|                   | learner starting if    |                         |
|                   | information is         |                         |
|                   | available, supporting  |                         |
|                   | teams with plans /     |                         |
|                   | strategies to support  |                         |
|                   | individuals. They also |                         |
|                   | work closely with the  |                         |
|                   | Specialist             |                         |
|                   | Practitioners with     |                         |
|                   | learners who access    |                         |
|                   | this support alongside |                         |
|                   | their studies. The LS  |                         |
|                   | Team will also provide |                         |
|                   | learning support for   |                         |
|                   | sessions, and training |                         |
|                   | for staff if           |                         |
|                   | requested.             |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | Student Support can    |                         |
|                   | also provide advice    |                         |
|                   | and guidance to        |                         |
|                   | departments,           |                         |
|                   | particularly with      |                         |
|                   | learners who score     |                         |
|                   | within the EIE         |                         |
|                   | parameters, and how    |                         |
|                   | they can be supported  |                         |
|                   | in lessons. They can   |                         |
|                   | also provide training  |                         |
|                   | to staff on request.   |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | The Quality Team       |                         |
|                   | provide training and   |                         |
|                   | support to Managers    |                         |
|                   | and teaching staff on  |                         |
|                   | how they can adapt     |                         |
|                   | resources and lesson   |                         |
|                   | delivery for           |                         |
|                   | individual needs. Our  |                         |
|                   | in-house teacher       |                         |
|                   | training courses also  |                         |
|                   | include sessions and   |                         |
|                   | units specifically     |                         |
|                   | targeted to teaching   |                         |
|                   | new teachers how to    |                         |
|                   | support the varied     |                         |
|                   | learner needs in their |                         |
|                   | classroom.             |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | The English and maths  |                         |
|                   | Team can support with  |                         |
|                   | re-allocating learners |                         |
|                   | to smaller size        |                         |
|                   | classes and undertake  |                         |
|                   | regular quality review |                         |
|                   | meetings to monitor    |                         |
|                   | learner progress and   |                         |
|                   | those at risk. A       |                         |
|                   | responsive model is in |                         |
|                   | place to ensure any    |                         |
|                   | learners highlighted   |                         |
|                   | in these meetings that |                         |
|                   | may need a different   |                         |
|                   | approach to access     |                         |
|                   | English and maths are  |                         |
|                   | catered for, within    |                         |
|                   | reason.                |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | There is a college     |                         |
|                   | wide offer to staff    |                         |
|                   | who want to learn more |                         |
|                   | with SEND              |                         |
|                   | qualifications and     |                         |
|                   | specific HE modules    |                         |
|                   | that staff can         |                         |
|                   | undertake part of      |                         |
|                   | their CPD. There is    |                         |
|                   | also a SEND Cog that   |                         |
|                   | staff can sign up to.  |                         |
|                   |                        |                         |
|                   | Accessible Technology  |                         |
|                   | and digital support    |                         |
|                   | and training is also   |                         |
|                   | available to support   |                         |
|                   | those teaching staff   |                         |
|                   | where learners need    |                         |
|                   | specific technology to |                         |
|                   | support the learning   |                         |
|                   | and/or to develop      |                         |
|                   | their skills in using  |                         |
|                   | Microsoft Immersive    |                         |
|                   | Reader, and other      |                         |
|                   | digital enhancements   |                         |
|                   | that can support all   |                         |
|                   | learners in the        |                         |
|                   | classroom.             |                         |
